  async function searchFunds(q){const market=$('mf-market-select').value,res=await fetch(`/mf/search?q=${encodeURIComponent(q)}&market=${market}&limit=20`);if(!res.ok)return;const rows=await res.json();$('mf-autocomplete').innerHTML=rows.slice(0,15).map(x=>`<div class="ac-item" data-id="${escapeHtml(x.identifier||x.scheme_code||x.symbol)}" data-name="${escapeHtml(x.scheme_name||x.symbol)}">${escapeHtml(x.scheme_name||x.symbol)} <small>${escapeHtml(x.quote_type||'')}</small></div>`).join('');$('mf-autocomplete').classList.toggle('hidden',!rows.length);$('mf-autocomplete').querySelectorAll('.ac-item').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{$('mf-search-input').value=el.dataset.name||el.textContent.trim();$('mf-autocomplete').classList.add('hidden');analyzeFund(el.dataset.id,market);}));}
  async function analyzeFundFromInput(){const market=$('mf-market-select').value,q=$('mf-search-input').value.trim();if(!q)return;if(market==='US'&&/^[A-Za-z0-9.\-^]+$/.test(q))return analyzeFund(q.toUpperCase(),market);const res=await fetch(`/mf/search?q=${encodeURIComponent(q)}&market=${market}&limit=20`),rows=res.ok?await res.json():[];if(!rows.length)return showMFError('No matching funds found.');const first=rows[0];$('mf-search-input').value=first.scheme_name||first.symbol||q;analyzeFund(first.identifier||first.scheme_code||first.symbol,market);}
  async function analyzeFund(id,market){$('mf-results').classList.add('hidden');$('mf-error').classList.add('hidden');$('mf-loading').classList.remove('hidden');try{const res=await fetch(`/mf/analyze/${encodeURIComponent(id)}?market=${market}`);if(!res.ok)throw new Error((await res.json()).detail||'Fund analysis failed');const d=await res.json();currentFundData=d;renderFund(d);$('mf-results').classList.remove('hidden');}catch(err){showMFError(err.message);}finally{$('mf-loading').classList.add('hidden');}}
  function showMFError(msg){$('mf-error-msg').textContent=msg;$('mf-error').classList.remove('hidden');}
  function setFundReturnBox(id,value,label){const box=$(id);if(!box)return;box.classList.remove('metric-good','metric-caution','metric-bad','metric-neutral');if(value==null){box.classList.add('metric-neutral');return;}const v=Number(value);box.classList.add(v>=8?'metric-good':v>=0?'metric-caution':'metric-bad');const signal=box.querySelector('.metric-signal');if(signal)signal.textContent=v>=8?'Positive':v>=0?'Modest / context':'Negative';}
  function fundHistoryChronological(d){return [...(d.history||[])].reverse().filter(x=>Number.isFinite(Number(x.nav)));}
  function drawFundNavChart(d){const history=fundHistoryChronological(d),n=mfPeriodSessions[mfChartPeriod]||253,rows=history.slice(-Math.min(n,history.length)),labels=rows.map(x=>x.date),navs=rows.map(x=>Number(x.nav));if(mfNavChart)mfNavChart.destroy();mfNavChart=new Chart($('mf-nav-chart'),{type:'line',data:{labels,datasets:[{label:'NAV / Price',data:navs,borderWidth:2,pointRadius:0,tension:.08}]},options:{responsive:true,interaction:{mode:'index',intersect:false},plugins:{legend:{display:false}},scales:{x:{ticks:{maxTicksLimit:7}}}}});}
  function drawFundBenchmarkChart(d){const rows=d.benchmark?.comparison_history||[];if(mfBenchmarkChart)mfBenchmarkChart.destroy();if(!rows.length){const c=$('mf-benchmark-chart');const ctx=c.getContext('2d');ctx.clearRect(0,0,c.width,c.height);return;}mfBenchmarkChart=new Chart($('mf-benchmark-chart'),{type:'line',data:{labels:rows.map(x=>x.date),datasets:[{label:'Fund (100 base)',data:rows.map(x=>x.fund_index),borderWidth:2,pointRadius:0,tension:.05},{label:d.benchmark?.name||'Benchmark',data:rows.map(x=>x.benchmark_index),borderWidth:2,pointRadius:0,tension:.05}]},options:{responsive:true,interaction:{mode:'index',intersect:false},plugins:{legend:{display:true}},scales:{x:{ticks:{maxTicksLimit:7}}}}});}
